- "Show opportunities"
- "What should I bid on?"
- "Find me contracts"
- "Agency targets"
- "What am I pursuing?"

**AUTOMATED SEQUENCE:**

```
1. Read DDI_TARGET_AGENCY_HIT_LIST.md
