3. Query Airtable GPSS OPPORTUNITIES for:
   - BID NOW tier opportunities
   - WORTH A LOOK tier
   - Deadlines within next 14 days

4. Generate prioritization report:
   
   "🔴 BID NOW (Score 75+):
   - [Agency] [Service] [Deadline] [Score]
   - Folder: [path]
   - Status: [last action]
   
   ⏰ UPCOMING DEADLINES (Next 7 Days):
